After all these days of planning and measurements, we can finally quite confirm the update time of full release to half a month awayːsteamhappyː. 

Here I'm excited to share the new stuffs we added to it, functions are 99% completed now (can also check the roadmap in community) :
http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/26616853/4ffb5893ba64614e62dce9dcb745068670df5d58.jpghttp://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/26616853/0081223830c54a2b5b4f53e4ac1f9764e76f4847.jpghttp://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/26616853/93fe7834ac07eb7099fabb5eeb71fa7db2ae6b44.jpg

1. One new PVE map and 3 new PVP maps;

2. Ultra gene buff system;

3. New story acted by fresh native speakers’ voice;

4. Up to 8 different weapons added;

5. A Unique and mind blown PVP mode!

I still saved features to remain untold here :p. You may see them on some news we release later~

P.s. Game price would have a raise as we described in early access Q&A before. No influence to those already made the purchase though.

