Hey, long time no see~
I'm really happy to bring this good news here----Finally an official version available for Oculus Rift! 

Details:

1. Oculus Touch adaptation, no more aiming angle or shot gun problems(maybe still few tiny bugs, we'll keep testing); 

2. Less performance problems in 2nd Level this time. We run it on much more kinds of circumstances with different GPUs and CPUs. (Yet still not include 980ti);

3. Enemy born points optimized: Fixed the circumstances enemy born stuck by obstacles;

4. Bullet Time: A bit increased the rate of slow motion.

